[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22208.788, "timestamp": "06:10:08", "text": "是的。是啊，这很难。还没完。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22211.47, "timestamp": "06:10:11", "text": "就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22215.91, "timestamp": "06:10:15", "text": "嗯，我觉得如果你在现实生活中谈论这件事的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22219.99, "timestamp": "06:10:19", "text": "嗯，就现实生活而言，我觉得……嗯，好像不是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22222.15, "timestamp": "06:10:22", "text": "有人当面告诉你……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22225.35, "timestamp": "06:10:25", "text": "那东西，但你得自己想办法。如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22228.07, "timestamp": "06:10:28", "text": "一种感觉就像是对你感到恼火，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22230.628, "timestamp": "06:10:30", "text": "比如走开或者无视你，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22232.47, "timestamp": "06:10:32", "text": "远离你或切断与你的联系"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22234.868, "timestamp": "06:10:34", "text": "默默地或者类似的事情，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22239.19, "timestamp": "06:10:39", "text": "你是怎么知道的，嗯……我猜是这样，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22242.15, "timestamp": "06:10:42", "text": "差不多就是这样。有点奇怪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22244.75, "timestamp": "06:10:44", "text": "系统，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22247.83, "timestamp": "06:10:47", "text": "是的，事情就是这样运作的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22255.11, "timestamp": "06:10:55", "text": "所以有人会说，骑师，这是基本操作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22257.35, "timestamp": "06:10:57", "text": "常识之类的东西，但记住这一点。"}]